post.description:
Raises an alert. The `Idempotency-Key` header is REQUIRED: replaying
the same key with the same body returns the original alert (200);
the same key with a different body is 409 idempotency-conflict.

ApxEventSubscription.description:
Superset of the APDS 4.1 EventSubscription. A stock APDS client sending
only `{endpoint, topics}` (EventTypeEnum values) gets stock behavior;
the APX fields are additive and optional.
